Then
          <me>
            \begin{split}
            AB \amp= \mat{a_1 a_2 \cdots, a_n}\vec{b_1 b_2 \vdots, b_n}
            = a_1b_1 + a_2b_2 + \cdots + a_nb_n \\
            \amp= \mat{b_1 b_2 \cdots, b_n}\vec{a_1 a_2 \vdots, a_n}
            = B^TA^T.
